BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jigsaw - A queer mingle doing puzzles together
DTSTART:20260719T130000
DTEND:20260719T130000
UID:6cd33e125437f3fa87a3d304efbb22bf@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Yes! It&#x27\;s doing jigsaw puzzles with strangers! We know i
 t is tough to meet new people in Toronto. Glad Day brings you a relaxed wa
 y to meet new people - working on a jigsaw puzzle together! This is great 
 for queers who want to make more connections. How does it work? You will c
 hoose the kind of table group you want to be with. You will have 3 hours t
 o work on a puzzle. If there are enough people\, we might mix up the table
 s half way through so you meet even more people. We will have puzzles to c
 hoose from but you can also bring our own puzzles to share &lt\;3 This one
  is PWYC with lots of FREE spots! All funds go towards Glad Day&#x27\;s co
 mmunity programming. For this one you can identify your preferred table gr
 oup\, but we cannot guarantee enough people show up or sign up to make the
 se happen\, so your table might be mixed. Sapphic Guys for Guys T4T QTBIPO
 C Anyone\, any age As with all our events\, this is trans and non-binary i
 nclusive. Accessibility The space is fully accessible. The entrance is acc
 essible\, with working buttons. There are 2 accessible washrooms and an el
 evator between floors. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/jigsaw---a-queer-mingle-doing-puzzles-toge
 ther
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
