BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Las Malinches presents: Tóxicas vs Románticas
DTSTART:20260724T223000
DTEND:20260724T223000
UID:eb48e6c1d9da338c99b971289aa3bc6f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Sapphic reggaetón &amp\; latinx party ❤️‍🔥 LAS MALIN
 CHES PRESENTS: TÓXICAS VS. ROMÁNTICAS ❤️‍🔥 Choose your side. Fo
 r our fourth edition\, Las Malinches steps into the arena. Inspired by the
  theatrical world of latin lucha libre\, we&#x27\;re reimagining one of Me
 xico&#x27\;s most iconic cultural traditions through a sapphic lens. Expec
 t a night of reggaetón\, Latin pop\, perreo\, immersive visuals\, perform
 ances\, and interactive moments designed to bring everyone into the story.
  More reggaetón. More perreo. More community. More surprises. Whether you
 &#x27\;re Team Románticas or Team Tóxicas... The arena is waiting. ❤
 ️‍🔥 🎧 Lineup ❤️‍🔥 The one and Only Momocita 👑 ❤️
 ‍🔥La Malinche ❤️‍🔥 Performers will be called out soon 👀 
 📍 Venue: Rivoli 332-334 Queen St W 📅 Friday\, July 24th ⏰ 10:30 PM
  – 2:30 AM ❤️About the theme This edition draws inspiration from the
  theatrical world of Mexican lucha libre\, where larger-than-life characte
 rs\, rivalries and audience participation are at the heart of the experien
 ce. Tóxicas and Románticas are playful\, fictional archetypes inspired b
 y the humor\, drama and storytelling found in reggaetón and Latin popular
  culture. They are intentionally exaggerated and are not meant to stereoty
 pe\, define or judge anyone. Like every great wrestling match\, every stor
 y needs characters. This edition simply invites you to choose one for the 
 night. PLEASE READ BEFORE PURCHASING Las Malinches is an intentionally cur
 ated space for sapphics\, including lesbian\, bisexual and pansexual women
  (cis &amp\; trans)\, trans men\, non-binary and Two-Spirit people who ide
 ntify as sapphic. We celebrate the many ways sapphic people exist and expr
 ess themselves\, and we&#x27\;re committed to creating a space centered on
  joy\, safety and community. This event is not open to cisgender men. Las 
 Malinches is a private gathering designed to prioritize the comfort and ce
 lebration of our community. This is a 19+ event. A valid physical governme
 nt-issued ID is required for entry. Photography and video will be captured
  throughout the night. By attending\, you acknowledge that media may be ta
 ken during the event. If you would prefer not to appear in photos or video
 s\, please let a member of our team know and we&#x27\;ll do our best to ac
 commodate you. ‍
LOCATION:The Rivoli\, 334 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/las-malinches-presents-toxicas-vs-romantic
 as
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
