 uff your feathers and then take flight into the night. This is BIRDBATH. R
 usted and Bodywaves are moving things into the daylight and to the great o
 utdoors\, taking advantage of the summer weather and the lush oasis laid b
 y our friends at Soleil\, and gathering a mixed flock from across our city
 ’s top-tier music ecosystems for an afternoon-into-evening of cooey conv
 ergence\, luscious libations and sonic sensations. Local breeds a plenty\,
  our time together will be guided by the pristine plumage of several city 
 species\, with the special migratory return of a rare Pittsburgher Yinzer.
  Don your flamboyant plumage\, or come as you are\, and make BIRDBATH a sa
 tiating stopover spot on your sultry summer migration. Super early BIRD\, 
