DESCRIPTION:It’s Euchre - but you change partners after every game and t
 urn a stranger into a friend! NEW: We will have an area of &quot\;Seasoned
 &quot\; players! Glad Day brings you another fun way to meet other queers 
 in Toronto. EUCHRE FOR QUEER STRANGERS Euchre is a card game that has pair
 s playing against another pair. Every new game you are placed with a new p
 erson - so you will meet 6-16 new people in about 90 minutes! This is grea
 t if you are VISITING TORONTO and want to connect with locals or if you ar
 e a local person looking to make connections. Never played before? No prob
 lem! Just come at 8pm for a little lesson and practice. The real games wil
 l start at 8:30pm. There are 15 free spots and the rest are sliding scale 
 $7-$20. All funds go to supporting Glad Day’s non-profit work. 8pm - Les
 son for Beginners 8:30pm - First Game Starts 10pm - Expected End... but yo
 u can stay a bit longer 11pm - We probably kick you out The entrance\, was
 hrooms and space are wheelchair accessible. Note: The FRONT DOOR IS NORTH\
 , facing the park. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
